<!-- Primary SEO -->
<title>Kamalarani Foundation — Free Art & Education for Village Children in West Bengal</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kamalarani Foundation is a registered non-profit in West Bengal offering free art classes, educational support, and drawing materials to children in rural Coochbehar and North 24 Parganas. Enroll your child today — 100% free.">
<meta name="keywords" content="Kamalarani Foundation, free art classes West Bengal, NGO Coochbehar, free education village children, Natabari art class, non-profit West Bengal, Sanatani culture, child welfare India">
